# Sajtagent Sprites

Read and follow `/AGENTS.md`.

- This repository owns privileged agent and Sprite execution, not the web UI.
- OpenClaw is private behind a narrow, signed controller API.
- Tool authority is server-owned, job-scoped, short-lived, and auditable.
- Customer code executes in isolated secret-free workers.
- Prefer one bounded verified loop over speculative orchestration layers.
